[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/final_report.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>UK Retail Fuel Price Trend Analysis — February 2026</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.3/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #0d2137;
    --blue: #1a56a8;
    --blue-light: #2e78d2;
    --blue-pale: #e8f0fb;
    --green: #1e7e34;
    --amber: #d97706;
    --red: #b91c1c;
    --grey-50: #f8f9fa;
    --grey-100: #f1f3f5;
    --grey-200: #e9ecef;
    --grey-400: #adb5bd;
    --grey-600: #6c757d;
    --grey-800: #343a40;
    --text: #1a1e2e;
    --border: #dee2e6;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --fuel-e10: #2563eb;
    --fuel-b7s: #16a34a;
    --fuel-e5: #9333ea;
    --fuel-b7p: #ea580c;
    --fuel-hvo: #0891b2;
    --fuel-b10: #854d0e;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--grey-50);
  }

  /* ── Header ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .site-header {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }
  .header-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 32px 0 28px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .header-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #c8daf8;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -.3px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .header-subtitle {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #94b4d8;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .header-meta {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #7a9cbe;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .header-meta strong { color: #c4d8ef; display: block; font-size: 13px; }

  /* ── Nav ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .toc-bar {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }
  .toc-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .toc-inner::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .toc-link {
    display: block;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #c8daf8;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: color .15s, border-color .15s;
  }
  .toc-link:hover { color: #fff; border-bottom-color: #7fb3f5; }

  /* ── Layout ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .page-body {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 40px 80px;
  }

  /* ── Sections ───────────────────────────────── */
  .report-section {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 32px 36px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
  }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--blue-pale);
  }
  .section-num {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--blue);
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--blue-pale);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  /* ── KPI cards ──────────────────────────────── */
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--grey-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .kpi-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 4px;
    background: var(--blue);
    border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;
  }
  .kpi-card.green::before { background: var(--green); }
  .kpi-card.amber::before { background: var(--amber); }
  .kpi-card.red::before { background: var(--red); }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--grey-600);
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -.5px;
  }
  .kpi-unit { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--grey-600); margin-left: 2px; }
  .kpi-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--grey-600);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ── Tables ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .data-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .data-table th {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #e8f0fb;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }
  .data-table th:first-child { border-radius: 6px 0 0 0; }
  .data-table th:last-child { border-radius: 0 6px 0 0; }
  .data-table td {
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grey-200);
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .data-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .data-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--grey-50); }
  .data-table tr:hover td { background: var(--blue-pale); }
  .data-table .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-align: right; }
  .data-table .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }

  /* ── Chart containers ───────────────────────── */
  .chart-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .chart-row.wide { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; }
  .chart-row.full { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .chart-row, .chart-row.wide { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .chart-box {
    background: var(--grey-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px 22px;
  }
  .chart-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .chart-subtitle {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--grey-600);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .chart-wrap { position: relative; }
  .chart-wrap canvas { max-width: 100%; }

  /* ── Inline stat pills ──────────────────────── */
  .stat-inline { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 8px 0 16px; }
  .stat-pill {
    background: var(--grey-100);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--grey-800);
  }
  .stat-pill b { color: var(--navy); }

  /* ── Fuel type badge ────────────────────────── */
  .ft { font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11.5px; }
  .ft-e10 { background: #dbeafe; color: #1d4ed8; }
  .ft-b7s { background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; }
  .ft-e5  { background: #f3e8ff; color: #7e22ce; }
  .ft-b7p { background: #ffedd5; color: #c2410c; }
  .ft-hvo { background: #cffafe; color: #0e7490; }
  .ft-b10 { background: #fef9c3; color: #854d0e; }

  /* ── Findings list ──────────────────────────── */
  .findings-list { counter-reset: finding; list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .findings-list li {
    counter-increment: finding;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grey-200);
  }
  .findings-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .finding-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .finding-body {}
  .finding-title { font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 14.5px; }
  .finding-text { font-size: 13.5px; color: #3a4050; line-height: 1.55; }
  .finding-policy {
    margin-top: 6px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    background: var(--blue-pale);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #1a3a6e;
  }
  .finding-policy b { color: var(--blue); }

  /* ── Alert boxes ────────────────────────────── */
  .alert {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 16px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    border: 1px solid;
  }
  .alert-info { background: var(--blue-pale); border-color: #93c5fd; color: #1e3a6e; }
  .alert-warn { background: #fffbeb; border-color: #fcd34d; color: #78350f; }
  .alert-icon { font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }

  /* ── Bar (inline SVG) ───────────────────────── */
  .bar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 5px 0; }
  .bar-label { font-size: 12px; width: 90px; flex-shrink: 0; text-align: right; color: var(--grey-800); }
  .bar-track { flex: 1; background: var(--grey-200); border-radius: 4px; height: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
  .bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; }
  .bar-pct { font-size: 12px; width: 42px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--grey-600); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  /* ── Footer ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .report-footer {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--grey-600);
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--grey-600); font-style: italic; margin-top: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ HEADER ════════════════════════════════ -->
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="header-badge">Analytical Report</span>
      <h1 class="header-title">UK Retail Fuel Price Trend Analysis</h1>
      <p class="header-subtitle">A data-driven examination of forecourt pricing patterns, market competitiveness, and retailer reporting behaviour across the UK government open data feed — February 2026.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <strong>Report Date: April 2026</strong>
      Dataset period: Feb – Apr 2026<br>
      Records analysed: 50,000<br>
      Audience: Policy Analysts &amp; Economists<br>
      Classification: Unclassified / Public
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="toc-bar">
  <div class="toc-inner">
    <a class="toc-link" href="#overview">1. Overview</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#price-by-fuel-type">2. Price Distribution</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#price-spread">3. Market Competitiveness</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#update-freshness">4. Reporting Freshness</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#station-coverage">5. Station Coverage</a>
    <a class="toc-link" href="#key-findings">6. Key Findings</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="page-body">

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ SECTION 1: OVERVIEW ══════════════════ -->
<section class="report-section" id="overview">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-num">Section 01</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Dataset Overview &amp; Coverage Summary</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-label">Total Price Records</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">50,000</div>
      <div class="kpi-note">From the UK Government Fuel Finder feed</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card green">
      <div class="kpi-label">Unique Forecourts</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">7,373</div>
      <div class="kpi-note">Distinct node_id hashes (anonymised)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-label">Fuel Types Present</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">6</div>
      <div class="kpi-note">E10, B7_STANDARD, E5, B7_PREMIUM, HVO, B10</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card amber">
      <div class="kpi-label">Dataset Date Range</div>
      <div class="kpi-value" style="font-size:18px;">Feb–Apr 2026</div>
      <div class="kpi-note">recorded_at: 7 Feb – 16 Apr 2026</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-label">Outlier Records (&lt;100p or &gt;250p)</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">174</div>
      <div class="kpi-note">0.35% of records; excluded from distributional analysis</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>This dataset is a 50,000-record sample drawn from the UK Government's mandatory Fuel Finder open data scheme, compiled by fuelcosts.co.uk. Each record represents a single fuel price observation at an anonymised forecourt. The <code>source_updated_at</code> timestamp in the raw data extends back to December 2025, indicating some stations had not refreshed their reported prices since late 2025 at the time of collection.</p>

  <div class="alert alert-info">
    <span class="alert-icon">ℹ</span>
    <div><strong>Data integrity note:</strong> 174 records (0.35%) carry prices outside the plausible 100–250 pence range (including values as low as 0p and as high as 1,889p), likely data entry errors or test records. These are flagged as outliers and <em>excluded</em> from all distributional and spread statistics in Sections 2 and 3. Raw counts are preserved in the dataset overview above. Additionally, 1,011 records (2.0%) exhibit a negative update lag (source timestamp after recorded timestamp), which may indicate clock-skew or feed submission anomalies — these are excluded from freshness analysis.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-box">
      <div class="chart-title">Records by Fuel Type</div>
      <div class="chart-subtitle">Share of the 50,000-record sample (all records, including outliers)</div>
      <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:260px">
        <canvas id="chartFuelTypePie"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-box">
      <div class="chart-title">Station Coverage by Fuel Type</div>
      <div class="chart-subtitle">Number of unique forecourts reporting each fuel type</div>
      <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:260px">
        <canvas id="chartStationCovBar"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ SECTION 2: PRICE DISTRIBUTION ══════ -->
<section class="report-section" id="price-by-fuel-type">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-num">Section 02</span>
